This project ports the e-means algorithm from faiss `contrib/e_means`
(https://github.com/facebookresearch/faiss, commit
2b648f0605f2ef3d14c4705350f8a0b214463878), by Swann Bessa, Pierre-Emmanuel
Mazaré, Gergely Szilvasy, Hugo Touvron, David Picard, Matthijs Douze and Hervé
Jégou (arXiv 2611.09501). The recipe (batch and step laws, epoch plan,
cosine schedule), the EMA update, centroid revival, the spherical variant and
the fused top-1 assignment idea of its Triton kernel come from that code.

